SUMMARY:DroneArt Show: Harry Potter™
DESCRIPTION:Watch 1\,200 illuminated drones light up the night sky in a 60-minute open-air show set to the iconic music of the Harry Potter™ films\, with a live electric violinist on stage! \nThe drones take flight in perfect synchronization to recreate some of the most beloved moments from the wizarding world in breathtaking formations of light. Settle in on the lawn or in the seating area — pure wonder\, nostalgia and enchantment\, on a scale you won’t forget. \nEnjoy treats and other delights. The perfect way to start the night before the show. Butterbeer™ will be available at select venues. \nTake home a souvenir celebrating the world of Harry Potter™ with exclusive merchandise: wands\, scarves and collectibles designed for fans of all ages. \nLearn more and buy tickets here: https://feverup.com/m/746195 \nLocation: Randall’s Island Park\, Sunken Meadow Fields
URL:https://randallsisland.org/events/droneart-show-harry-potter/2026-10-23
CATEGORIES:Arts & Culture,Special Event
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://randallsisland.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/400-x-400-photos-39.png
END:VEVENT
