SUMMARY:2026 Jesse Owens Track & Field Youth Program at Boo Bash!
DESCRIPTION:Join the Randall’s Island Park Alliance and City Parks Foundation for the Jesse Owens Track and Field Youth Program! This free weekly program is available to youth ages 8-16 and enables participants to learn the fundamentals of the sport and stay active. Activities will focus on running techniques for sprints and relays and will introduce other track and field activities like long jump\, hurdles\, and long-distance running.  \nThis week’s event will take place before our annual Boo Bash event at Randall’s Island Park! \nRegistration is required on LeagueApps with City Parks Foundation.  \nLocation: Hilltop Picnic Area/Urban Farm \nFor inquiries about accessibility\, to request an accommodation or for event information\, please email publicprograms@randallsisland.org. 
